WEBVTT

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:07.940
<i>I have to wonder, do I really look 
like this because of a curse?</i>

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:14.400
<i>It was just an avatar before, 
but if it really is because of a curse now...</i>

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:18.010
<i>The mid-tier Bishop class has Uncurse...</i>

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:21.840
<i>I may be able to use it on myself to lift it.</i>

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.500
<i>Let's try just the tip.</i>

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.300
Uncurse!

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:33.710
<b>U
n
c
u
r
s
e</b>

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:53.650
<b>U
n
c
u
r
s
e</b>

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:51.670
Uncurse!

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.480
Uncurse! Uncurse!

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:05.200
Uncurse! Uncurse!

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:51.010
<i>Good morning. It's me, Arc.</i>

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:54.700
<i>As the sun rose, we set out for Olav,</i>

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:57.910
<i>the capital of the Rhoden Kingdom.</i>

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:02.800
<i>That's where we'll find the individuals 
listed on the trafficking contract.</i>

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:06.280
<i>In other news...</i>

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:11.790
<i>I was able to confirm that my body 
looks like this because of a curse.</i>

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:20.240
<i>However, while the curse
can be lifted temporarily...</i>

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:23.000
<i>it comes right back.</i>

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:27.890
<i>Either the curse is self-perpetuating, 
or there's something else going on.</i>

00:03:28.720 --> 00:03:31.710
Are you all right? You seem distracted.

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:34.440
Oh, it's nothing important. Worry not.

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:36.230
If you're sure...

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:39.400
We're nearly out of the woods.

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:02.360
Arc! Not that way!

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:04.090
Doesn't really matter right now!

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:08.690
So, you're afraid of bugs then, Arc?

00:04:08.690 --> 00:04:11.810
When chased by ones 
of that kind of size... I certainly am.

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:16.520
You know, people fry their 
mid-sections and eat them.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:17.880
Remarkable...

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:20.510
I imagine it must make for quite a sight.

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:22.820
It's actually nice and crunchy.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.280
You should try some next time.

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:28.490
I'll make an attempt, 
should the opportunity arise again.

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:32.450
So, about tomorrow...

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:38.000
Most people take a carriage 
on the road next to the forest to reach Olav.

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:44.190
But I think we should cut 
through the forest as a shortcut.

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:46.920
The sooner we arrive, the better, after all.

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:49.880
You folks are thinking 
about cutting through the woods?

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:53.260
I wouldn't. It's too dangerous in there.

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:54.390
It's dangerous?

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:56.800
There's monsters in those woods.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:00.080
I think they were called haunted wolves...?

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:03.980
Been ten people attacked 
in just the last few days!

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:06.820
Haunted wolves...

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.800
And they show up often?

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:12.260
Not until recently, no!

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:14.330
Just stay clear of the woods, if you can.

00:05:16.210 --> 00:05:17.820
I assume from your expression

00:05:17.820 --> 00:05:21.140
you'd like to move as swiftly as possible 
to save the other elves.

00:05:22.190 --> 00:05:25.510
You need not worry. Between the two of us...

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:27.310
Right.

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:30.880
Haunted wolves shouldn't 
be much of a threat...

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:34.620
In that case, let's head 
to the woods tomorrow, as planned.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:42.070
m 0 0 l 248 0 l 248 30 l 0 30

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:42.070
Olav, Capital of the Rhoden Kingdom

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.980
Your guards will rendezvous 
with us further down the road...

00:05:56.980 --> 00:05:59.430
but I was told there wouldn't be many.

00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:02.080
Are you in that much of a hurry?

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:06.480
The greater the numbers, 
the slower our pace.

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:11.310
We must reach the Grand Duchy 
of Limbult with all possible haste.

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.750
We'll be setting out, now.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:35.830
This is around where the monsters 
were said to appear...

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:37.130
Right.

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:38.520
Is something troubling you?

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:42.830
W-Well... the tails of haunted wolves...

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:49.180
Their fur gives off a blue light, 
and veils with that fur woven into it...

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:52.840
are considered the finest 
possible gift for a bride-to-be.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:58.480
And my sister is actually 
getting married soon...

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:03.320
So, you'd like to obtain haunted 
wolf tails for a veil, then?

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:05.140
I know.

00:07:05.140 --> 00:07:08.020
We don't have time to waste 
on that kind of thing.

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:09.190
Forget I mentioned it.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.230
Arc!

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:18.830
Speak of the devil dogs, 
and they appear, it seems.

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:39.810
I-Illusions?!

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:40.800
Arc!

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:47.320
Crap! I just remembered...

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:48.810
Allow me to explain!

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:53.940
Haunted wolves are a type 
of lupine monster that attack in packs!

00:07:53.940 --> 00:08:00.280
They create multiple illusions of themselves 
in order to confuse their prey during a hunt...

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:05.700
They're especially dangerous, thanks to 
the pack leader's keen command and intellect!

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.070
There's no end of them!

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:18.830
Stone of flames, heed my call.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:21.190
Strike my enemy down!

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:27.930
Look out, Lady Ariane!

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:31.530
Oh, great Earth...

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:39.310
<i>She's good!</i>

00:08:39.310 --> 00:08:44.720
<i>The way she fights after having been 
a warrior for so long is a great example.</i>

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:50.590
<i>Raw power shows its weaknesses 
when dealing with multiple enemies...</i>

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:57.410
<i>And until I have a better grasp 
on my ranged skills and magic,</i>

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:58.720
<i>I should be careful with them.</i>

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:01.560
<i>So, in order to get out of this situation...</i>

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:08.730
<i>The boss needs to go down! Dimension Move!</i>

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:14.810
<i>That's...!</i>

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:28.230
Fire!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:30.840
<b>F
i
r
e</b>

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:04.040
Arc! What was that?

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:07.860
Were you fighting 
with the leader of the pack?

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:11.210
What is that?

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:25.020
Episode 7

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:25.020
A Miracle for the High-Minded Princess

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:33.440
And those rings were 
on the giant basilisk you fought, too?

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:40.180
More creatures in areas 
they're not native to.

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:44.310
Could the rings have 
something to do with it?

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:46.160
I cannot say.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:55.620
Arc, could you give me a moment?

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:56.710
What for?

00:10:56.710 --> 00:11:00.440
I mean, I know we're in a hurry, but...

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:02.360
Still, it'd be such a waste...

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:05.930
and I promise not to take too long, so...

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:09.390
A gift for your sister, right?

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:12.860
Let us take a brief rest, then.

00:11:12.860 --> 00:11:13.850
Thank you!

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:16.580
Let's bleed them, on the double!

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:49.960
Miss Yuriarna, would you please relax, 
and have something to eat?

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:52.060
Thank you, Ferna...

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:54.130
Is something troubling you?

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:56.400
Yes.

00:11:56.820 --> 00:12:01.590
This mission to the Grand Duchy of Limbult 
was under Father's orders.

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:05.150
It's been carried out in secret thus far,

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:07.880
but I can't help but feel anxious...

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:12.950
Brother Dakares is likely involved 
with the elf slave trade.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:16.760
He's bound to be displeased 
with this round of negotiations.

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:20.440
And I doubt Brother Sekt, 
with his ambitions for the throne,

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:22.840
will let things play out 
without getting involved.

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:26.050
I just hope there's no trouble.

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:30.800
Enemies!

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:32.230
We're under attack!

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:34.800
Princess!

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:44.940
That should do nicely.

00:12:45.410 --> 00:12:48.820
<i>I have a lot to learn from today's battle.</i>

00:12:49.230 --> 00:12:51.920
<i>I have all these battle skills and magic,</i>

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:55.240
<i>but until I learn how to use them, 
they're wasted on me.</i>

00:12:56.050 --> 00:13:00.080
<i>I should ask Lady Ariane for combat training 
when there's a free moment.</i>

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.900
What's the matter, Ponta?

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:09.710
Ponta? Hey!

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:12.420
Lady Ariane, pardon me, 
but wait here for a bit.

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:14.140
Not a problem.

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:21.190
Did something happen, Ponta?!

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:26.280
Don't let them near the princess!

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:28.160
Keep them from the carriage!

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:48.360
Please run, Princess—

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:55.640
Ferna!

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:28.450
Well done.

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:29.090
Sir.

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:31.640
Make sure it looks like the work of bandits!

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:35.920
Any valuables are yours, 
on top of your payment.

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:39.110
A memento of Princess Yuriarna.

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:47.280
What a shame that the princess 
had to meet such a tragic fate.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:51.650
What is it?

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:55.120
S-Sir, there's this weird animal...

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:00.990
Kill the bloody thing, then.

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:03.440
Good idea!

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:13.720
What do you people think you're doing?

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:22.730
Who is he?!

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:24.360
If he's seen what happened, he needs to die!

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:26.120
Fire Beretta!

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:27.070
Rock Shot!

00:15:27.350 --> 00:15:29.830
She's dressed like a highborn...

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:31.320
<i>I guess they killed her.</i>

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.020
<i>If this was an online game,</i>

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:39.960
<i>heals or resurrections from a passing player 
would be appreciated with no problems...</i>

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:42.760
<i>But is it a good idea 
to do it in this world?
</i>

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:43.340
What the hell is this thing?! 
We're not scratching him!

00:15:43.340 --> 00:15:44.790
He's some kind of freak!

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:48.080
What the...?!

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:50.510
It's you...

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:53.760
Where'd they come from?!

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:05.110
I suppose first I'll dispose of the pests!

00:16:16.250 --> 00:16:20.190
Several got away, but that seems 
to have settled the matter.

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:36.350
I've got my doubts,

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:40.590
but let's just chalk this up to being safe 
since no one is around to see it.

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:43.270
Regeneration!

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:44.600
<b>R
e
g
e
n
e
r
a
t
i
o
n</b>

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:49.060
<i>This magic revives someone 
with their vitality fully restored...</i>

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.170
<i>But if the damage was too severe,</i>

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:54.710
<i>or too much time has passed 
since death, then it can fail.</i>

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:57.740
<i>Did I make it in time?</i>

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:05.360
Yes!

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:11.020
Ponta, keep an eye on this girl.

00:17:11.020 --> 00:17:13.250
I'm going to see if I can revive the others.

00:17:14.930 --> 00:17:16.090
Regeneration!

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:21.300
Regeneration!

00:17:28.480 --> 00:17:31.360
The body's too badly damaged for this one...

00:17:31.770 --> 00:17:35.030
Regeneration! Regeneration!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:43.010
Regeneration! Regeneration! 
Regeneration! Regeneration!

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:48.730
<i>Is that... an angel...?</i>

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:58.600
Princess? Princess!

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:00.320
Princess!

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:02.000
Princess! Princess!

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:05.030
Ferna...?

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:10.760
Ferna! You're alive?!

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:12.650
Yes!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:16.740
I awoke just now, 
without a single scratch.

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:19.330
Some of the men are still dead,

00:18:19.330 --> 00:18:21.640
but most seem to have been 
brought back to life.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:24.100
What in the world could have happened?

00:18:30.780 --> 00:18:32.840
My dress is bloodied.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:35.720
That was no dream.

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:40.370
We were attacked, 
and killed, by some force...

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:43.580
Princess! You're alright!

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:45.600
But what could have done this?

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:49.960
I'm sure this was a miracle sent by God.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.520
Ferna. Gather the men.

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:53.310
Of course.

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:57.860
Attention!

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:02.240
Her Highness, Princess Yuriarna, 
will now speak!

00:19:02.840 --> 00:19:04.100
Brave soldiers.

00:19:04.100 --> 00:19:07.720
Moments ago, we were struck down 
by some foe, and were as good as dead.

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:11.360
However, God did not forsake us.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:15.590
It was by His divine providence 
that we were revived!

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:19.410
Which means we are obliged to move forward!

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:22.310
We must repay the mercy we 
were shown on this day!

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:25.920
There is no longer anything 
that can stop us!

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:29.720
We ride for Limbult at once!

00:19:35.220 --> 00:19:37.520
Swap out the horses on the carriage!

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:40.060
Try to capture as many horses as possible!

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:44.950
<i>I figured she was just some 
noble, but actual royalty?</i>

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:43.000
And don't leave any weapons 
that can still be used behind!

00:19:46.970 --> 00:19:48.930
<i>When I stop and think about it,</i>

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:53.530
<i>magic that can revive 
the dead might be a bad idea.</i>

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:57.470
<i>And when we're talking about resurrecting 
a princess who was murdered...</i>

00:19:58.390 --> 00:20:01.430
<i>This is probably going to 
be historically significant.</i>

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:04.870
W-Well, it's probably fine, right, Ponta?

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:09.870
Welcome back, Arc.

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:13.020
That took a while. What were you up to?

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:15.000
W-Well, uh... you know,

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:17.780
just some odds and ends. 
Not anything significant.

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:20.400
You seem to be done, as well.

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:22.660
This should be more than enough fur!

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:24.750
It should make for a lovely veil.

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:26.520
I see.

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:28.110
Then shall we be on our way?

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:29.000
Right!

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:36.170
m 0 0 l 196 0 l 196 30 l 0 30

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:36.170
Royal Capital, Olav

00:20:40.390 --> 00:20:42.720
Come on up! See our wares!

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:44.880
We've got the best deals!

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:48.600
We'll make you a bargain!

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:58.760
I suppose this is 
the city's thriving heart.

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:00.720
It's certainly lively.

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:04.570
You little shit!

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:06.200
You think you can talk to me like that?!

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:09.360
After we were trying to be nice!

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:11.120
Some kind of fight?

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:14.000
Honestly... it's so barbaric.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:16.720
Don't you ignore me, you—

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:20.340
My eyes! My eyes!

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:20.340
Hey! That's playing dirty!

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:24.180
All at once, if you would.

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:26.060
What did you say, you runt?!

00:21:26.060 --> 00:21:27.390
You'll regret that!

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:29.710
Shall we aid the young lady?

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:32.600
I wouldn't. There's no need.

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:36.960
See?

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:40.020
She made short work of them!

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:47.310
Lady Ariane! I think she's locked onto me!

00:21:47.310 --> 00:21:49.520
You shouldn't have been staring!

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:51.020
Hello there.

00:21:51.020 --> 00:21:52.260
It's good to see you again.

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:57.620
I'm pleased to see your mission 
in Diento seems to have been a success.

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:03.280
It's you... from before!

00:22:04.540 --> 00:22:06.170
The furry-eared ninja!

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.020
Episode 8

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.020
Allied! Dashing Through the Darkness With the Beastpeople!

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.030
<b>When I'm around, even monsters become buddies.
#ActuallyADog #HangingWithPonta</b>
